            "kind": "fetch",
            "title": "Count the KRAS mutation calls per cohort and study, and those the query keeps",
            "detail": "The mutations:counts query above: every called KRAS mutation in each cohort's samples (uncalled calls left out), with the sample's CANCER_TYPE_DETAILED and MUTATION_COUNT where recorded and the OncoKB v7.5 call for its protein change; allele frequency = variant / (variant + reference) reads. The query keeps rows Protein Change matches /^G1[23]/; Allele Freq (T) ≥ 0.2.",
            "params": [
